        d.workTapePos 1 - 1 ≤ (zr_rightPassContract x).lo D d 1 ∧
          (zr_rightPassContract x).hi D d 1 ≤ d.workTapePos 1 + ↑(zoneCapacity D.fst) + 1
@zr_rightPass_tape : ∀ {k : ℕ} {x : List (ZoneSym k)} (D : zr_RightData k)
